AI COMMAND CENTER — ROADMAP
================================================================

PHASE 1 — FOUNDATION .................................... DONE (v0.4.0)
    FastAPI + SQLite (aiosqlite, async, migration-managed),
    modular boundaries (provider, model router, agent, team,
    workspace, tools, research, git, security, observability),
    env config, JSON structured logging, unified errors,
    health checks, encrypted credential vault, path sandbox.

PHASE 2 — PREMIUM CHAT .................................. DONE (v0.4.0)
    Real SSE streaming chat against Ollama; history, search,
    rename, delete, archive, pin, favorites; stop, retry,
    regenerate; markdown + GFM; syntax-highlighted code w/ copy;
    model selector; system prompt + custom instructions; exact/
    estimated token labels; context meter; error states; auto-
    titles from the local model. Zero simulated responses.

PHASE 3 — MODEL CENTER + TOKEN/COST SYSTEM .............. DONE (v0.4.0)
    Live Ollama discovery, categories, search/filter/sort,
    favorites, recently used, selection, speed tests, safe
    pull/delete. Per-model token/cost ledger. Strict €0
    CostGuard (FREE_ONLY, MAX_SPEND, pre-network blocking,
    no paid fallback) — tested against bypass attempts.

PHASE 4 — AGENT MODE + PROJECTS + COMPARE ................ DONE (v0.4.0)
    - Controlled Agent: PLAN → EXECUTE → VERIFY → FIX →
      FINALIZE with sandboxed file tools, allowlisted commands
      (no shell), timeouts, full audit; per-step persistence.
    - Projects: first-class workspaces (files, tasks, chats,
      settings) that Agent/Team runs can target.
    - Compare Mode: N models answer one prompt side-by-side,
      select best, combine answers.

PHASE 5 — TEAM MODE (FLAGSHIP) .......................... DONE (v0.4.0)
    - 2–4 models: task intake → joint analysis → master plan
    - Role assignment by measured capabilities + manual override
    - Shared board (TODO/IN PROGRESS/REVIEW/DONE) with manual
      control; shared events (decisions, findings, errors)
    - Review → fix → final review → delivery with deliverable
    - Per-member + TEAM TOTAL token accounting, €0.00 cost
    - Models run sequentially (single GPU)

PHASE 6 — RESEARCH MODE ................................. DONE (v0.4.0)
    - Real multi-source search (DuckDuckGo; disable-able)
    - Citations, source list, excerpts, notes, summary,
      comparison, markdown export
    - Never fabricates sources — failures are explicit
    - Search provider can be extended (engine seam)

PHASE 7 — GIT / GITHUB INTEGRATION ...................... DONE (v0.4.0)
    - Real status, diff, log, branches, add/commit in sandboxed
      project workspaces (audited, argv-only)
    - GitHub repos/issues/PRs (real REST) with encrypted token
      storage; explicit unauthenticated state otherwise

PHASE 8 — EXTENSIBILITY ................................. PLANNED
    - Additional providers via the registry (cloud providers enter
      with real per-token prices → immediately subject to CostGuard)
    - Plugin tools, themes, export/import, encrypted backups
    - Research: additional search engines; Team: parallel lanes
      for multi-GPU setups

RULES: no fake features — every boundary answers honestly (real data,
an explicit unavailable state, or a real error); €0 protection can
never regress; schema evolves only via new migrations.
